<p>Have you Googled it? It is essentially first language. I settled for this since I find &quot;first&quot;, &quot;native&quot; and &quot;mother&quot; a bit colloquial for my tastes, and I personally regard my first language, native language and mother tongue as separate languages altogether.</p>
<blockquote>
