<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>So, coming up with a crosslink for this article left me stumped until I PMed MrWrong who was kind enough to share in the lore behind this article and provide some insight into possible crosslinks that would work. According to MrWrong:</p>
<blockquote>
<p>The Ascetics are literally themed after Journey to the West, a famous Chinese novel, and Ascetic Sun is literally Sun Wukong. And the site has at least two articles that feature or allude to Sun Wukong, like SCP-2711 and SCP-2178.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>As such, I am recommending the following edits:</p>
<p>Changing this:</p>
<blockquote>
<p>An illustration depicting 'Ascetic Sun'. According to the 'Ascetics to Heaven's Pillar', 'Ascetic Sun' is held to be the previous incarnation of the Victorious Fighting Buddha, a deity revered by the group.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>To this:</p>
<blockquote>
<p>An illustration depicting 'Ascetic Sun'. According to the 'Ascetics to Heaven's Pillar', 'Ascetic Sun' is held to be the previous incarnation of the Victorious Fighting Buddha, a deity revered by the group. See SCP documents <a href="/scp-2711">SCP-2711</a> and <a href="/scp-2178">SCP-2178</a> for more details.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>Thank you MrWrong.</p>
<p>If anyone has other/better examples that could be used here please leave a comment saying so!</p>
</div>
